cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Drone Building Scans — Two Commercial Buildings"
abstract: >-
  Two complete drone photogrammetry image sets of commercial buildings in the Minneapolis
  suburbs, captured August 2026 with a DJI FC9313 at native 4096x3072 resolution. A single
  storey building (951 images, 951 aligned) and a two storey building (395 images, 384
  aligned). Both flown below 16 m with gimbal angles spanning nadir to level, covering the
  structures from above and from the side. GPS intact on every frame, original aircraft
  filenames preserved. Solved camera poses in COLMAP format, sparse tie point clouds, and
  textured reference models are included. One scan is metrically scaled from a 1.997 m
  AprilTag calibration bar used as control points.
authors:
  - family-names: Guertin
    given-names: Matthew
    website: "https://mattguertin.com"
date-released: 2026-08-22
